# Optional local-website template. Safe to commit — no secrets.
#
# The Android / iPhone app does NOT read this file.
# Point the phone at the live hosted site instead:
#
#   export CAP_SERVER_URL="https://YOUR-LIVE-APP.vercel.app"
#   npm run cap:sync:android
#
# Copy to `.env` only if you run the website on this computer.
# Put real API keys on the hosted app (Vercel), never in the Android APK.

# Live site the Capacitor WebView should open (no trailing slash).
CAP_SERVER_URL=

# MarketCheck RV inventory search (server-only; never ship in the APK).
# Required on the hosted app (Vercel env vars) for Facts → Local inventory.
# Alias: MC_API_KEY. Personal plans typically cap search radius at 100 miles.
MARKETCHECK_API_KEY=
